<title>USA: Ohio to sell $282 mln education bonds on March 20.</title>
<headline>Ohio to sell $282 mln education bonds on March 20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ohio plans to sell $282.3 million higher education bonds in a competitive sale on March 20, a market source said Monday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
